{"seq":1,"slug":"anonymization-and-pseudonymization","title":"匿名化与假名化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/deidentification-and-pets/anonymization-and-pseudonymization","wordCount":1952,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"匿名化与假名化\">匿名化与假名化</h1><p>一个工程师最容易踩的坑，是把「我把姓名字段删了」当成「这份数据不再受 GDPR 约束」。这两件事相差十万八千里。GDPR 第 4(5) 条对假名化（pseudonymisation）的定义是：经过处理后，个人数据在不借助「额外信息」的情况下无法再归属到特定数据主体，且该额外信息被单独存放、受技术与组织措施保护。注意——假名化后的数据<strong>仍然是个人数据</strong>，仍在 GDPR 全部义务之下；只有达到真正匿名化（anonymisation）的数据才脱离 GDPR 适用范围（见 <a href=\"https://edpb.europa.eu/news/news/2025/edpb-adopts-pseudonymisation-guidelines-and-paves-way-improve-cooperation_en\">EDPB Guidelines 01/2025 on Pseudonymisation, 2025-01-16</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.gtlaw.com/en/insights/2025/1/edpb-publishes-guidelines-on-pseudonymization\">Greenberg Traurig 解读</a>）。这条「可逆 vs. 不可逆」的红线，决定了你后续所有合规设计的走向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>去标识化（de-identification）是一个总称：任何切断「标识数据」与「数据主体」关联的处理过程都属于它。NIST SP 800-188 把它拆成三大手段——删除直接标识符、变换准标识符（quasi-identifier）、用模型生成合成数据（<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/188/final\">NIST SP 800-188, 2023-09</a>）。假名化和匿名化是这条谱系上的两个刻度，区别不在「用了什么算法」，而在「再识别的可能性是否被合理排除」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原始个人数据&lt;br/&gt;含直接标识符 + 准标识符] --&gt; B{是否保留&lt;br/&gt;可逆映射?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是 保留映射表&lt;br/&gt;单独存放| C[假名化数据&lt;br/&gt;仍是个人数据&lt;br/&gt;GDPR 全程适用]&#10;  B --&gt;|否 不可逆&lt;br/&gt;排除合理再识别| D[匿名化数据&lt;br/&gt;脱离 GDPR 范围]&#10;  C --&gt; E[内部分析 / 纵向追踪&lt;br/&gt;受控环境]&#10;  D --&gt; F[公开发布 / 对外共享]&#10;  C --&gt; G{再识别风险&lt;br/&gt;评估}&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt;|风险过高| A\">flowchart TD\n  A[原始个人数据&lt;br/&gt;含直接标识符 + 准标识符] --&gt; B{是否保留&lt;br/&gt;可逆映射?}\n  B --&gt;|是 保留映射表&lt;br/&gt;单独存放| C[假名化数据&lt;br/&gt;仍是个人数据&lt;br/&gt;GDPR 全程适用]\n  B --&gt;|否 不可逆&lt;br/&gt;排除合理再识别| D[匿名化数据&lt;br/&gt;脱离 GDPR 范围]\n  C --&gt; E[内部分析 / 纵向追踪&lt;br/&gt;受控环境]\n  D --&gt; F[公开发布 / 对外共享]\n  C --&gt; G{再识别风险&lt;br/&gt;评估}\n  D --&gt; G\n  G --&gt;|风险过高| A</pre><p>三个关键术语必须分清：<strong>直接标识符</strong>（姓名、身份证号、手机号——能单独定位个人）、<strong>准标识符</strong>（邮编、出生日期、性别——单独看无害，组合起来可能唯一）、<strong>敏感属性</strong>（病种、薪资——攻击者真正想知道的）。Sweeney 的经典研究表明，仅「五位邮编 + 出生日期 + 性别」三项准标识符，就能唯一识别美国约 87% 的人口。删掉姓名而不处理准标识符，等于把门锁了却把窗户大开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>假名化</th>\n<th>匿名化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GDPR 法律地位</td>\n<td>仍是个人数据，全部义务适用</td>\n<td>脱离 GDPR 范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可逆性</td>\n<td>借助额外信息可逆</td>\n<td>不可逆，排除合理再识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型手段</td>\n<td>加盐哈希 + 映射表分离、token 化</td>\n<td>k-匿名、差分隐私、合成数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要价值</td>\n<td>降低泄露影响、支持内部纵向分析</td>\n<td>安全对外发布与共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败模式</td>\n<td>映射表泄露 → 完全还原</td>\n<td>准标识符残留 → 链接攻击再识别</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-简单哈希-不算假名化\">为什么「简单哈希」不算假名化</h2><p>EDPB 在 2025 年指南里反复强调一句话：仅对标识符做简单哈希、不做假名化域管理、不分离额外信息，<strong>不构成合规的假名化</strong>（<a href=\"https://edpb.europa.eu/news/news/2025/edpb-adopts-pseudonymisation-guidelines-and-paves-way-improve-cooperation_en\">EDPB Guidelines 01/2025</a>；<a href=\"https://trilateralresearch.com/cybersecurity/unpacking-the-edpb-pseudonymisation-guidelines-key-insights-and-learnings\">Trilateral Research 解读</a>）。原因是工程层面的：哈希是确定性函数，攻击者若知道输入域，可以做暴力枚举或字典攻击。</p>\n<p>设手机号空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，未加盐哈希 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\in D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 都可预计算。中国手机号有效号段约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|D| \\approx 2 \\times 10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对现代 GPU 而言整张彩虹表可在分钟级算完——所谓「哈希保护」形同虚设。正确做法是引入与映射域绑定、单独保管的密钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，使用带密钥的伪随机函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>HMAC</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = \\text{HMAC}_k(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HMAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>此时还原 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 就是 GDPR 所说的「单独存放、受技术与组织措施保护的额外信息」。这正是「假名化域管理」的核心——密钥轮换、域隔离（同一人在不同业务域得到不同假名，防跨域链接）、密钥访问审计，都属于必须文档化、定期更新的稳健方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"准标识符的形式化防护-从-k-匿名到-t-接近\">准标识符的形式化防护：从 k-匿名到 t-接近</h2><p>假名化解决「直接标识符」，但准标识符的链接攻击需要另一套武器。k-匿名（k-anonymity）要求：数据集中每条记录在准标识符上，至少与其他 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 条记录无法区分，即每个等价类大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。这把「精确定位某人」的概率压到至多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>但 k-匿名有著名缺陷：它防住了「身份披露」，却防不住「属性披露」（<a href=\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-032-06497-4_56\">AEPD / Springer 评测</a>）。若某个等价类里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个人的敏感属性全是「艾滋病」，攻击者无需定位具体是谁，就已经知道了你的病情。于是有了递进式加固：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[k-匿名&lt;br/&gt;每等价类 &gt;= k 条记录&lt;br/&gt;防身份定位] --&gt; B[l-多样性&lt;br/&gt;每等价类敏感值 &gt;= l 种&lt;br/&gt;防同质攻击]&#10;  B --&gt; C[t-接近&lt;br/&gt;类内敏感值分布&lt;br/&gt;与全局分布距离 &lt;= t&lt;br/&gt;防分布偏斜攻击]&#10;  C --&gt; D[差分隐私&lt;br/&gt;对查询加噪&lt;br/&gt;提供数学化最坏情况保证]\">graph TD\n  A[k-匿名&lt;br/&gt;每等价类 &gt;= k 条记录&lt;br/&gt;防身份定位] --&gt; B[l-多样性&lt;br/&gt;每等价类敏感值 &gt;= l 种&lt;br/&gt;防同质攻击]\n  B --&gt; C[t-接近&lt;br/&gt;类内敏感值分布&lt;br/&gt;与全局分布距离 &lt;= t&lt;br/&gt;防分布偏斜攻击]\n  C --&gt; D[差分隐私&lt;br/&gt;对查询加噪&lt;br/&gt;提供数学化最坏情况保证]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>l-多样性</strong>（l-diversity）：要求每个等价类内敏感属性至少有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 个不同取值，堵住同质攻击。</li>\n<li><strong>t-接近</strong>（t-closeness）：进一步要求等价类内敏感属性的分布，与整体分布的距离不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，防止「类内分布严重偏斜」泄露信息。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>NIST SP 800-188 同时把 l-多样性、t-接近与差分隐私列为正式隐私方法（<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/188/final\">NIST SP 800-188</a>）。但即便堆到 t-接近，业界共识仍是 k-匿名家族「总体偏弱」，对高维数据尤其乏力——这就是差分隐私登场的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差分隐私-当前最强的通用保证\">差分隐私：当前最强的通用保证</h2><p>k-匿名守护的是「数据集长什么样」，差分隐私（differential privacy, DP）守护的是「任意一个人是否在数据集里」这件事本身。其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>-DP 定义为：对任意相邻数据集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（仅差一条记录），任意输出集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>ε</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pr[M(D) \\in S] \\leq e^{\\varepsilon} \\cdot \\Pr[M(D&#x27;) \\in S]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 是「隐私预算」：越小越私密，常用范围在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 之间。它的革命性在于——无论攻击者掌握多少背景知识，都能给出最坏情况下的信息泄露上界。这是「与攻击者先验知识无关」的数学保证，被认为是当前最强的通用隐私机制（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2411.04710\">arXiv 综述 2411.04710</a>；<a href=\"https://dualitytech.com/blog/k-anonymity-explained/\">Duality 解读</a>）。</p>\n<p>实务中三者并非互斥，而是分层组合。一个被反复推荐的混合框架是：内部运营与纵向追踪用<strong>假名化</strong>，可解释分析用 <strong>k-匿名</strong>，公开发布用<strong>差分隐私</strong>（<a href=\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-032-06497-4_56\">Springer 评测</a>）。它们之上还有更重的 PETs 栈——全同态加密、安全多方计算、联邦学习、机密计算——但那属于「隐私保护计算」的范畴，是另一个话题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地决策-选哪条路\">落地决策：选哪条路</h2><p>监管节奏值得盯紧：EDPB 已将匿名化与假名化两份指南列入 2026–2027 年工作计划（2026-02-11 通过），意味着合规口径仍在收紧（<a href=\"https://www.insideprivacy.com/gdpr/edpb-publishes-report-on-stakeholder-event-on-anonymisation-and-pseudonymisation/\">Inside Privacy</a>）。工程选型时，先问数据要去哪、能不能可逆、再识别风险评估谁来做。</p>\n<p>一条务实的判断链：数据若需保留可逆性以支撑内部纵向分析 → 走假名化，但务必做带密钥 PRF + 域隔离 + 密钥单独托管，并把这套方法文档化、定期更新；数据若要对外发布或共享 → 必须冲着「不可逆 + 排除合理再识别」去，优先差分隐私，退而求其次用 k-匿名叠 l-多样性/t-接近，且发布前做一次真刀真枪的再识别风险研究。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>假名化 ≠ 匿名化：前者仍是个人数据、GDPR 全程适用，后者才脱离监管——别把「删掉姓名」误当匿名化。</li>\n<li>简单哈希不构成合规假名化；正确做法是带密钥的 PRF（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>HMAC</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HMAC}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HMAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）+ 假名化域管理 + 额外信息单独存放（EDPB 01/2025）。</li>\n<li>区分直接标识符、准标识符、敏感属性；准标识符的链接攻击才是再识别的主战场（邮编+生日+性别可识别约 87% 美国人口）。</li>\n<li>k-匿名防身份披露但不防属性披露，需 l-多样性、t-接近递进加固；整体仍偏弱，高维数据尤甚。</li>\n<li>差分隐私以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 预算给出与攻击者先验无关的最坏情况保证，是当前最强通用机制。</li>\n<li>实务用分层组合：内部假名化 / 分析 k-匿名 / 公开差分隐私，并持续跟踪 EDPB 2026–2027 工作计划的口径变化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"匿名化与假名化","id":"匿名化与假名化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么「简单哈希」不算假名化","id":"为什么-简单哈希-不算假名化"},{"level":2,"text":"准标识符的形式化防护：从 k-匿名到 t-接近","id":"准标识符的形式化防护-从-k-匿名到-t-接近"},{"level":2,"text":"差分隐私：当前最强的通用保证","id":"差分隐私-当前最强的通用保证"},{"level":2,"text":"落地决策：选哪条路","id":"落地决策-选哪条路"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"规模化敏感数据发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/pii-identification-and-classification/sensitive-data-discovery-at-scale"},"next":{"title":"差分隐私","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/data-privacy-engineering/deidentification-and-pets/differential-privacy"}}